    turn.\n\n[ Monster Effect ] \nBefore damage calculation, if this card attacks
    an opponent's Defense Position monster: You can change the DEF of that opponent's
    monster to 0 until the end of the Damage Step. If this card attacks a Defense
    Position monster, inflict piercing battle damage. You take no battle damage from
    battles involving this card."
